{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"Y\",\n    \"small\": \"Y\",\n    \"core\": \"Y\",\n    \"concise\": \"Y\",\n    \"human\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：Y的大字抓住了“受过的气”“当作自己人”“没料到会这么孤单”等具体关键信息，单看强调部分也比较容易串出心理变化；X虽然大块信息完整，但抽象表达较多。small：Y的小字提供了更多具体的处境、动作和心理细节，补充价值较高；X多处小字重复大字已经表达的意思。core：Y把不愿再受委屈、怀念过去的亲近、害怕孤独和坚持不轻易回头串成了清楚的反复拉扯，核心更容易被普通观众看出来。concise：Y虽然单屏文字较多，但心理变化有递进；X在S02、S06、S07、S09等处出现了大字小字近乎复述的情况。human：Y明显更接近日常说话习惯；X的“把想念当作折返的依据”“不再把彻底释怀当成离开完成的条件”“继续承担这段离开”等表达偏书面、抽象。fine：X略好，像“胸口发紧、伸手只摸到空处”“后颈一凉、脉搏乱跳”等更直接地呈现观众的身体体验；Y有些感受文字实际在描述和弦、旋律和节奏本身。load：Y的大字是较短的自然意群，扫读成本较低；X的大块句子偏长，尤其在S03、S04等较短屏幕里，连续出现多个大块，对快速扫读要求更高。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a40a73ef-13dd-45cf-9fdd-78b3adc3486b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T151246182227Z", "elapsed_seconds": 258.359, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T15:17:04.545480+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6251dfe373b5551d113d6cea28285d98ec8ada56152e3951afdf49ed1fca9a1b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_coun